    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "After a long time in water, the skin on your fingers and toes gets wrinkly. It's totally normal!",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🖐️",
        "text": "Fingers and toes",
        "cue": "fingers",
        "sub": "Wrinkly after a long soak",
        "sub_cue": "wrinkly"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Is my skin soaking up water like a sponge?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Scientists found it's not just soaking! Your nerves help make the wrinkles.",
      "punch": "nerves",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "⚡",
        "text": "Nerves help!",
        "cue": "nerves",
        "sub": "Not just soaking",
        "sub_cue": "soaking"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "My nerves? How?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Your nerves tell tiny blood vessels under the skin to shrink. Then the skin on top folds into wrinkles.",
      "board": {
        "type": "flow",
        "title": "Wrinkle time",
        "packet": "💧",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "⚡",
            "label": "Nerves",
            "cue": "nerves"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🩸",
            "label": "Vessels shrink",
            "cue": "shrink"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🖐️",
            "label": "Skin folds",
            "cue": "folds"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "But why would my body do that?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Scientists think wrinkly fingers may help you grip wet things, like the treads on a tyre help on a wet road!",
      "punch": "grip",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🛞",
        "text": "Better grip?",
        "cue": "grip",
        "sub": "Like tyre treads",
        "sub_cue": "treads"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So I can hold my wet toys better?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Maybe! Scientists are still testing that idea.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🔬",
        "text": "Still testing!",
        "cue": "testing"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Will my fingers stay wrinkly forever?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "No way! After you get out and dry off, your wrinkly fingers soon go smooth again.",
